Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.70,0:00:45.80,Title,0,0,0,0,,《异形魔怪2：余震》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.64,0:04:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,小惹火 你如不自己走进栏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wildfire, you either walk into that other corral, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.58,0:04:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会打死你将你的尸体拖进去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or I am going to shoot you and drag your carcass in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.05,0:04:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 小惹火 来吧 乖孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Wildfire. Come on, boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.47,0:04:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在让我们一起去找苏丝吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go meet Susie now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.14,0:04:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会喜欢它的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will like her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.85,0:04:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你俩要好好相处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two got to get together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.59,0:04:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,捉到你啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotcha. Whoa, whoa. Whoa, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.96,0:04:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,站住 该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}boy, whoa. Whoa. Damn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.38,0:04:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 你和苏丝要造些小鸟来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and Susie are going to make some little birds, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.56,0:04:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不是 我就烤了你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or I'm gonna take some barbecue sauce to both of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.89,0:05:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是爱尔·巴锡 对吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Earl Basset, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.09,0:05:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你 那是另外一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you that's the other one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.93,0:05:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴锡先生…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Senor Basset.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.26,0:05:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个美丽但孤立的城市{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is beautiful country, but very isolated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.95,0:05:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我花了很多气力才找到你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had great difficulty finding you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.41,0:05:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴我的心血并没白费{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I am glad I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.09,0:05:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你见到吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.43,0:05:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们关闭了墨西哥最大的油田{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have had to close down one of Mexico's biggest oil fields.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.08,0:05:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好些工人被杀死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Several workers have been killed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.74,0:05:52.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们发现那些工人是被…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, we have now determined that…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.22,0:05:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,某些巨大 地下生物所杀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the men were killed by… certain large underground animals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.37,0:06:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,加博怪虫？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Graboids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.13,0:06:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 人们就是这样叫它们的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah. I told you that's what they named them. Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.70,0:06:13.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是否说 有很多这类生物？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean… there's more of them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.70,0:06:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 公司正面对最昂贵的停工{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. The company is facing very expensive delays.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.71,0:06:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,但最重要的是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But more importantly, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.96,0:06:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这区的居民大部份孤立自处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}there are many isolated people who live in the region.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.71,0:06:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个生命都受威胁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Many lives are in danger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.47,0:06:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们急需专家们去歼灭那怪物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need someone, an expert, to eliminate these creatures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.50,0:06:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想找人去捕捉加博怪虫？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want somebody to go graboid hunting?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.72,0:06:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Si.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.16,0:06:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 请听我说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, senor, please, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.34,0:06:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已和你的拍挡麦基谈过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have already spoken to your partner, Senor McKee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.69,0:06:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不愿意加入协助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He… he is unwilling to help us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.85,0:06:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然啦 他婚姻生活愉快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, Val married a good woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.17,0:06:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何他会去寻死？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would he want to die?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.74,0:06:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 我们愿意付出任何数目{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, we are willing to pay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.48,0:06:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 他们愿意付出任何代价{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course they're willing to pay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.04,0:07:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦…五万元{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fifty thousand…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.69,0:07:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,废话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go… away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.71,0:07:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是这个意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.16,0:07:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意付每只加博五万大元{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants to pay you $50, 000 for each graboid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.89,0:07:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,很动听 不答应 我不会为任何数目加入{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. No way. Not for any amount of money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.40,0:07:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,但对你来说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But for you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.19,0:07:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,对付那些虫只简直易如反掌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}getting those worms would be a piece of cake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.19,0:07:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁 为何你那么蠢钝？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you? And why are you so dumb?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.54,0:07:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是加迪何化{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Grady. Grady. Grady Hoover.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.74,0:07:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好荣幸认识你 巴锡先生 我应是你最大拥护者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an honor to meet you, Mr. Basset, sir. I am probably your biggest fan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.38,0:07:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个利薄球鞋广告{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That Reebok commercial with you guys{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.67,0:07:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一班人跑步跨沙漠 好帅{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}running through the desert… so very cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.90,0:07:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢那个广告？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You like that, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.18,0:07:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 十分喜欢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.09,0:07:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可否进来数分钟呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, could I come in? I mean, just for a second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.93,0:07:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.41,0:07:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.04,0:07:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,独一无二的爱尔·巴锡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Earl Basset.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.31,0:08:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.33,0:08:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我读过每个关于这些的故事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep. I have read every one of these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.71,0:08:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个我有两个复制品{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got two copies of this one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.43,0:08:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我将其中一个用塑纸包着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I keep one wrapped in plastic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.82,0:08:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢我的天 你也有一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God, you got your own one of these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.25,0:08:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 我相信这些令你赚了不少{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I bet you made a fortune off this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.49,0:08:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱呀 钱呀 钱呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quarter, quarter, quarter, quarter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.11,0:08:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他人做的 当然不是我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, somebody did. It sure wasn't me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.16,0:08:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 你一家有分一份利润{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you must have got a percentage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.18,0:08:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早该聘用一位律师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have got a lawyer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.50,0:08:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 那太不幸了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow… That sucks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.58,0:08:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真的愿意付五万元一只？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he really say $50, 000?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.85,0:08:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓 绝无虚假{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stack of Bibles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.01,0:08:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是算了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.16,0:08:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不知那些东西多恐怖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You boys don't know how mean these things are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.59,0:08:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好吧 但… 那是我的大好机会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, okay… okay, but… That was my big chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.86,0:08:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 但是巴锡先生…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but M-Mr. Basset…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.12,0:08:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只有一只 但都给我搅坏了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You only get one of those in life, and I blew it…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.49,0:09:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是那坏蛋大鸟和它瘦弱女伴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}on goddamn Big Bird and his scrawny girlfriend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.71,0:09:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 但五万大元嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but 50, 000.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.21,0:09:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那正是她在上面的原因？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what she's doing there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.88,0:09:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.71,0:09:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁？1974年十月小姐？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh."Miss October, 1974"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.34,0:09:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是她 她整天都在提醒我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, she's there to remind me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.21,0:09:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要费力追求得不到的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}not to keep chasing after things I am never going to get.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.65,0:09:23.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你又为何不去捉那些怪虫？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why wouldn't you get this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.89,0:09:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱尔？巴锡先生 你是位专家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Earl… Mr. Basset, you're the expert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.84,0:09:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们经常和这些东西搏斗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys kicked ass with those things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.67,0:09:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时这次你们比它们更胜一筹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this time, you will be a step ahead of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.71,0:09:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说墨西哥会供给你任何你想要的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said the Mexican army is willing to give you whatever you want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.95,0:09:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,炸药 机枪 好多五万大元{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dynamite. Shh, whoo, wa-bam. 50 Gs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.62,0:09:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者这次是你的第二次良机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe this is your big second chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.90,0:10:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥蒂加先生 我们就合作吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Senor Ortega, you have got a deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.13,0:10:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 太好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bravo, bravo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.21,0:10:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是否与他一起去呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I am going with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.37,0:10:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 很好 但这是不行的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, muy bien, muy bien. Um, if you will excuse me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.38,0:10:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？为何我长途跋涉到这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Why do you think I drove all this way?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.16,0:10:24.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,当他说他要找寻爱尔·巴锡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When he said he was looking for the Earl Basset, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.55,0:10:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知我的机会来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew Opportunity{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.56,0:10:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一时间 我便来到这处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}was knocking, and I was home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.85,0:10:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们素未谋面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even know you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.03,0:10:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是做的士司机 我家居破屋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I drive a taxi, I live in a crappy apartment, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.27,0:10:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看太多电视 等等 等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I watch too much TV, et cetera.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.18,0:10:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,想清楚 你将需要一个拍挡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you're going to need a partner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.17,0:10:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,有多少人愿意做这危险工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many people would want to do this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.60,0:10:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会为你做所有的事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will do anything you want:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.15,0:10:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,背你的行李 煮咖啡 点火等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carry luggage, make coffee, light fuses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.97,0:10:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,唔 或都你也有用得着的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you will come in handy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.01,0:10:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,当那些虫吞食你的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha. When they're eating you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.66,0:10:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我便可乘机逃脱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it will give me a chance to get away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.02,0:11:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 谁拿了最后一罐汽水？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who gets the last soda?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.73,0:11:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.69,0:11:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.03,0:11:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,包 剪 踏 一 二 三{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scissors, rock, paper. One, two, three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.07,0:11:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.70,0:11:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,较剪剪纸 我赢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scissors cuts paper. I win.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.87,0:12:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buenos dias, senores.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.87,0:12:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是去打怪物的那个美国人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ustedes dos son los americanos cazadores de monstruos? Um…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.92,0:12:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,请问…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um… Quien es… uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.96,0:12:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.08,0:12:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥蒂加先生在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Donde esta…" Senor Ortega?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.78,0:12:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥蒂加？呀 奥蒂加 你好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ortega? Oh, Ortega, venga aca. Estan aqui.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.32,0:12:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎各位 你们来得正好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome. Welcome, gentlemen. You made good time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.15,0:12:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们早些来到 就可早些走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sooner we get here, the sooner we can leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.47,0:12:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是本公司工程师-毕度{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Pedro, the company's chief engineer. Mucho gusto.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.58,0:12:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴认识你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, buenos dias. Ysu nuevo companero, el{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.47,0:12:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sr. Hoover.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.80,0:12:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有他的新朋友 何化先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mucho gusto. Buena suerte y que los monstruos no los coman a ustedes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.06,0:13:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你所需的装备都在那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, I have all your equipment over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.26,0:13:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便告诉你一个好消息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, by the way, I have some good news.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.51,0:13:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们能活捉一只怪虫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We offer you double the price{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.55,0:13:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们得到的酬劳是双倍计{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you are able to capture one of the animals alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.70,0:13:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,双倍？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Double?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.61,0:13:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,活捉？你有没有见过那些怪虫？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alive? Have you ever seen one of these things?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.34,0:13:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只不过是一个建议而已{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is only a suggestion…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.10,0:13:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果能活捉一只就最理想了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if it was possible to capture one of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.11,0:13:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情未发生 你永不知道结果{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you never know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.59,0:13:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱尔…你永不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Earl, you never know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.66,0:13:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然知道结果应如何？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.95,0:13:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是我不应来到这处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never should have come down here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.84,0:13:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,墨军已将你要求的一切送到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The army has sent everything you requested.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.14,0:13:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要求了一些不寻常的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have asked for some… Unusual things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.55,0:13:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,呵呵 爱尔 来看这些东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Earl, please check this out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.15,0:13:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 不要将这事看得太儿戏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, this isn't some kind of party.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.78,0:13:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我只想注进多些热情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that. I just think we should show a little enthusiasm here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.21,0:14:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我介绍姬.利莉给你认识{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me introduce you to Kate Riley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.60,0:14:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是本油公司的地质学家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's the geologist for the oil company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.73,0:14:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And these are the men…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.97,0:14:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知…我知他们是怪虫猎者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, I know. The monster hunters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.60,0:14:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在早晨美利坚见过你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw you on Good Morning, America… or, uh, one of those.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.33,0:14:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是爱尔·巴锡 独一无二的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, this is, uh, the Earl Basset, the one and only.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.41,0:14:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,说得对 很高兴认识你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, that's right. Nice to meet you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.64,0:14:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴认识你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really nice to meet you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.14,0:14:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是新成员加迪·何化{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Grady Hoover, the new guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.99,0:14:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.81,0:14:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好漂亮的帽子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}hat. Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.11,0:14:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.55,0:14:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你们很快会送来好消息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope to hear good news soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.49,0:14:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,利莉小姐负责与我保持联络{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Riley will stay in contact with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.72,0:14:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有任何需要 请告知我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us know anything else you need. And, uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.25,0:14:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 祝各位好运 愿主常在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, best of luck to you, huh? Vaya con Dios.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.35,0:14:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 这就是你们的居所{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is the place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.22,0:14:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会带你们到四周逛一逛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will show you around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.08,0:14:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们想喝些什么东西吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You thirsty or anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.24,0:14:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 我很口渴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, as a matter of fact, I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.02,0:14:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实在这区的人都很慌张{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, we have been pretty nervous down here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.10,0:15:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸好你们长途跋涉都到这里来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glad you guys were willing to come all this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.13,0:15:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里确是荒芜之地 鲜有人迹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It sure is in the middle of nowhere. Well, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.80,0:15:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 怪诞的事都在荒野发生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stuff like this only happens in the middle of nowhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.24,0:15:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 朱利奥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Julio.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.24,0:15:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 姬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Kate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.74,0:15:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样… 全部做妥 他们正在工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So? It's all done. They're all working. Yes, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.26,0:15:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 各位 这是朱利奥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, this is Julio.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.57,0:15:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就是为我们装置地震仪的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been setting up the seismographs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.88,0:15:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是爱尔·巴锡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Earl, Grady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.78,0:15:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我在报刊上全见过你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I have seen you in the magazines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.08,0:15:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 我不是正版队员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, I am not the original guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.36,0:15:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们一定赚很多金钱 对吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you must have made a lot of money, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.49,0:15:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,单是那电视游戏机 的版权….哇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The royalties on that video game alone. Ooh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.23,0:15:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,朱利奥 我们现在应有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Julio, we should be able to{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.58,0:15:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,正确的数地震方法 对吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}get an accurate count now, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.02,0:15:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 你知我朋友投资在这公司{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, yes. I have a friend who invested in that company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.68,0:15:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.08,0:15:53.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 你好 请进来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. Come on in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.21,0:15:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是否要查看一些地图呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh, we were going to look over some maps?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.26,0:16:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 唔…咖啡？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Um, coffee?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.62,0:16:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 黑咖啡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, black.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.99,0:16:07.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些墨西哥薄饼如何？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How were those burritos, anyway?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.59,0:16:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,唔…还好 还好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, good. Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.54,0:16:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,很不好意思 我知道簿饼味道差{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, sorry about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.07,0:16:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道很糟 但厨师跑了 那已是最好的了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty bad, I know. But with cook gone, that's best we have got.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.08,0:16:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,呀 有多少人仍然在外面工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, um… how many of you are still working out here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.48,0:16:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,唔…只有我们三人 公司要将工场关闭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only the three of us. They had to shut the whole operation down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.65,0:16:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,因有六人被杀 全部我都认识{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six people got killed… people I knew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.55,0:16:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你还待在这里工作？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm. Well, uh, how come you stayed on? Well…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.70,0:16:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你不害怕吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not scared?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.15,0:16:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然十分害怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit, yeah, I am scared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.69,0:16:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,但同时对这事极感兴趣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But… I am also fascinated. It's, uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.20,0:16:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我来说 兴趣胜于一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With me, "fascinated" usually wins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.16,0:16:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,地图…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.35,0:16:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会将那些核心拿走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will get these cores out of the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.34,0:16:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 宝贝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.66,0:17:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实加博怪虫有否靠近炼渍油厂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh, have the graboids come near the refinery yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.12,0:17:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 至今它们还没靠进附近{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, they have left us alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.72,0:17:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们大都在北面二十公里外出没{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They stay about 20 miles north.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.93,0:17:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,工人就在那处遇害{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where the workers were killed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.25,0:17:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 谁始创加博这名字呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who named them graboids, anyway?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.19,0:17:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,张华特 我们的一个朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A… friend of ours, Walter Chang.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.69,0:17:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,张为它们起名 而它们吃了他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He named them, then they ate him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.96,0:17:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 看我做了什么出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys, look what I made.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.72,0:17:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要把它拖在货车后面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just, you know, drag it behind the truck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.85,0:17:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,它就会发生更巨大的声响{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make, you know, make more noise. Just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.63,0:17:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,知吗 加博怪虫是声音捕食{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, uh, graboids hunt by sound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.71,0:17:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我立刻把它挂在货车后面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will probably just go hook that to the back of the truck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.40,0:18:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,难以置信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Moonstros."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.82,0:18:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, si.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.47,0:18:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,何化先生 请过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Hoover, come here please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.90,0:18:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不断用监察器侦察{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have the monitor working.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.13,0:18:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将电子地震仪放在每角落{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have set up radio seismographs all over, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.54,0:18:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我地震仪上有波动便是加博所在 - 棒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- so the monitor will show you where the graboids are. - Cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.27,0:18:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我这样问有点多管闲事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, this is none of my business, I guess, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.45,0:18:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我想知队伍是否只你一人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you guys are going out there alone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.27,0:18:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有否考虑带整队墨西哥去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want to take with you the whole army of Mexico?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.69,0:18:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,朱利奥 让我解释给你听{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me explain, Julio.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.46,0:18:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,加博怪虫是没有眼睛的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Graboids, they got no eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.56,0:18:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们依靠声音捕食{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They hunt by sound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.79,0:18:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,如你弄出轻微如脚步声 它们都可发现你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You make a noise. They're going to come after you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.57,0:18:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 若找一群人在这里走动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we get a bunch of people running around…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.62,0:19:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,加博便汹涌而至{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Graboids going to spread out all over the place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.20,0:19:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要加博只过来找我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we want them all to come to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.82,0:19:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 你们算是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you guys are what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.84,0:19:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是鱼饵吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys are the bait?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.98,0:19:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这根本就是我们的计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.01,0:19:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so, uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.85,0:19:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,全部人齐集 货车在那{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's us. That's our truck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.97,0:19:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来每样都进行得很顺利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems like everything's working okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.23,0:19:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然顺利啦 爱尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, sure it is, Earl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.34,0:19:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是高科技 专业化的行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a high-tech, professional operation here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.35,0:19:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 我们拥有一个完美计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, we got a good plan going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.24,0:19:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,五万大元一只 宝贝 哇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fifty thousand apiece, baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.03,0:19:49.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知我怎么样去捉我的加博？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ho. You know, me, I am going to get mine all at once, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.43,0:19:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,全部堆在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}just stacked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.52,0:19:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我再赚到钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if I make any money this time, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.22,0:19:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会很保守地去投资{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will invest it… conservatively.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.92,0:20:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 你剃须没有？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you shaved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.60,0:20:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.20,0:20:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 我发现你没剃须{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I just… I just noticed you… you know, shaved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.30,0:20:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又怎么样？每个男人都懂剃须{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what? A man can shave, can't he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.54,0:20:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 你说得对 她是个弱女子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you're right. She's a babe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.02,0:20:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.69,0:20:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们应在这里出没{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}here's where they're supposed to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.58,0:20:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 欣赏一下这个城市 什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, look at that country, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.26,0:20:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 并没有太多的石头岩石{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Not a lot of rocks and boulders out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.24,0:21:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实没有什么可攀爬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not much to climb on if we don't want to get slurped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.58,0:21:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里四周有很多山峰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's mountains around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.00,0:21:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说它们不能攀越山峰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said they can't get through mountains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.69,0:21:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾说过它们不能穿越岩石{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said they can't go through rock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.22,0:21:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这些山丘是沙石冲积而成{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These hills are alluvial.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.77,0:21:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲积土？等下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, "alluvial." Wait a minute, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.17,0:21:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不就是你的忧虑吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's the little dingleberry in the back of your throat, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.34,0:21:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,如想捕捉加博{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to hunt graboids, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.61,0:21:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好对地质学有认识{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you better know geology.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.08,0:21:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 你驾驶 我看着这地震仪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, you drive. I am keeping my eye on this… seismo-jigger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.30,0:21:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, good call.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.94,0:21:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有恶意 爱尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No offence, Earl, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.28,0:21:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你为何惊慌得如一只小狗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you're nervous as a chihuahua.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.78,0:21:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是紧张 只是保持警觉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not nervous. I am alert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.19,0:21:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎说怎好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.45,0:22:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,如那些怪虫没听到我们的尖叫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those worms have to be deaf{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.13,0:22:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们就真的聋的厉害{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if they don't hear us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.66,0:22:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 轻松一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, take it easy, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.00,0:22:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呀 加迪 一只出现了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, Grady. We got one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.00,0:22:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,它看到我们啦 它朝我们走过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's spotted us. It's coming right toward us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.66,0:22:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这正是我们的目的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's the idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.87,0:22:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知这是我们的目的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that's that's the idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.91,0:22:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但并不表示我要去欢迎这景况{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't mean I have to like it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.40,0:22:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 停止 你可否停下来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now stop. Stop already.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.85,0:22:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦 秘密武器表演时间到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, time for the secret weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.08,0:22:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心那雷管 按照我教导你的方法装置{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful with that detonator. Set it like I showed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.50,0:22:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为我很蠢吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How dumb do you think I am?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.62,0:22:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍后才告诉我吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Catch me later on that one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.68,0:23:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他来了 我相信他在跟踪它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's coming in. I think he's following it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.89,0:23:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,它肯定是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.50,0:23:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看不到它 爱尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't see it, Earl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.63,0:23:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱尔 我看不到它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Earl, I can't see it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.67,0:23:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,左 爱尔左 左{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Left. Left. Left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.34,0:23:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 好 - 等下 在这{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, okay. - Wait. Wait, there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.08,0:23:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他成功啦 他捉到它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did it. He took it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.74,0:23:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 打它 打它 捉住它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}O-Okay. Hit it. Get him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.50,0:23:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱尔 你在做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit. Earl, what are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.59,0:23:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,打它 打它 打它 爱尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hit it. Hit it, Earl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.76,0:23:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈哈 五万元 宝贝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoo-hoo-hoo. 50 Gs, baby, 50 Gs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.35,0:23:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,五万大元{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.48,0:24:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,早告诉过你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.77,0:24:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我忘记了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I forgot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.18,0:25:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 这东西真的极臭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, this stuff really stinks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.70,0:25:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要忘记连触须也带走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, don't forget to get that antenna too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.04,0:25:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你留下收音机在地上？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You left the radio on the ground?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.33,0:25:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起…我忘记了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, I forgot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.05,0:26:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是只豺狼吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a coyote?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.56,0:26:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.49,0:26:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,它最好不要作声{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, he better keep quiet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.36,0:26:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.41,0:26:26.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它捉了它 - 喂 轮到我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He took it. - Hey, it's my turn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.52,0:26:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 来吧 爱尔 给我打多一只 不好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, c-come on, Earl. Let me get one more. Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.92,0:26:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,踏破剪 我赢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rock breaks scissors. I win.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.93,0:26:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It does?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.64,0:26:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,早告诉你一击便足够{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you one stick would be enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.86,0:26:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.63,0:26:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那便有三十万元了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That makes $300, 000.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.64,0:26:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,一只{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apiece.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.86,0:26:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 我太聪明了 爱尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am feeling light-headed, Earl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.09,0:27:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算怎么样花这些酬劳？ 投资{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what are you going to do with all your money?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.56,0:27:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 当然 投资 但…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Invest it. Well, yeah, of course, invest it, but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.25,0:27:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,纵只有五厘回报 已是好收入{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even at five percent, I will be doing pretty good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.59,0:27:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,五厘？你是说公债或定期或…？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five percent? You're talking, um, mutual funds or CD's or something, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.89,0:27:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是 那太少了 爱尔 你思想太保守{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right. That's small, Earl. You're thinking small.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.17,0:27:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我 我想有一番作为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, I am thinking big, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.74,0:27:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am thinking…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.01,0:27:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,建游乐场 那…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}theme park. Now, now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.34,0:27:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,何化生态世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Grady Hoover's World of Natural Wonders."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.71,0:27:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 或者简单{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa. Or, you know, maybe something simple, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.43,0:27:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,如怪兽世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}like "Monster World", or "Monsterland"…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.52,0:27:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者怪物乐园{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or "Worm World."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.99,0:27:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫做卡通世界乐园好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about "Looney World"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.03,0:27:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,很合衬 走离地面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems to fit. Get off the ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.36,0:27:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是有远见 爱尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's vision, Earl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.49,0:27:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,远见是分开平凡的界线…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vision is what separates the average…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.00,0:27:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂那首歌曲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that song.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.68,0:28:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,天 离开地面 加迪 离开地面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus. Get off the ground, Grady. Get off the ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.26,0:28:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,天 那些东西真是巨大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, man, those things are huge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.72,0:28:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要作声 你有没有看见那张嘴？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh. Be quiet. Did you see that mouth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.23,0:28:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好 它挣开那铁链{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. It snagged the chain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.56,0:28:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,它能这样吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can it do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.75,0:28:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,它不该这样强壮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can't be that strong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.63,0:28:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗娘养的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.37,0:29:02.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,快踏刹车擎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hit the brakes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.81,0:29:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有 我有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am. I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.10,0:29:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,但它失灵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.94,0:29:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Earl. What do I do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.95,0:29:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我什么也不知道 - 噢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't know. Do anything. - Ooh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.11,0:29:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 卡里夫 - 不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cliff. - Oh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.33,0:29:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,它停下来 它停下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He stopped. He stopped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.49,0:30:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 不好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.51,0:30:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.39,0:30:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,石头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rock. Rock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.29,0:30:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,它由底部穿过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's going under it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.50,0:30:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,转…转那轮子 转{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn. Turn the wheel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.27,0:30:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 转 - 我正在尝试转 我正在尝试{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Turn. - I am trying, I am trying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.57,0:30:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 我的天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God, oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.38,0:30:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.03,0:30:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.39,0:31:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 铁链断了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, chain broke right off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.29,0:31:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝 我们走运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, we're lucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.20,0:31:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 货车好像没损坏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, truck seems to be all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.20,0:31:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱尔 那将是我游乐场的首程{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Earl, that's going to be the first ride in my theme park.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.43,0:31:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有任何东西令你受挫吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't anything ever get you down?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.72,0:31:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,上天赐给我一个开朗的性格{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I am blessed with a sunny disposition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.38,0:31:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常受人们欢迎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most people seem to like it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.85,0:31:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 这对你的开朗有何帮助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah? What does this do for your disposition?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.95,0:31:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信我们需要援手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we're going to need some help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.54,0:31:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,援手？在这混乱的情景{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help? Who'd be crazy enough{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.97,0:31:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,有谁会走来帮忙？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to help us with this mess?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.11,0:32:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.38,0:32:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 毕…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Burt, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.55,0:32:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是爱尔 你好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's Earl. How you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.25,0:32:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,听住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, um, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.61,0:32:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这听来有些古怪 因为我用广播电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this sounds kind of funny, it's because I am on a radio phone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.42,0:32:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我唯一可与你联络的方法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only way we can call out of this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.67,0:32:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱尔？呀爱尔 很久没见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Earl? Oh… Earl. Haven't seen you in a while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.27,0:32:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也很久没见你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I haven't seen you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.27,0:32:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你近来一定很休闲 对吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess you have been laying kind of low, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.27,0:32:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,休闲？错 我才忙得要紧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Laying low? No. Negative.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.27,0:32:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多大工程等着我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have been real busy… lots of projects.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.86,0:32:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和希达都好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh, how you and Heather doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.62,0:32:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,她…她还在她姐姐处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, she, uh… She's still visiting her sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.54,0:32:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.18,0:32:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,基本上 她将我们之间的问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, she actually…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.22,0:32:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,都推御在苏联崩溃所导至{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}blames our problems on the collapse of the Soviet Union?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.71,0:32:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你都忍住气 毕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you did take that kind of hard, Burt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.05,0:32:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说我很难相处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said I was hard to live with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.11,0:32:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,又说 没世界大战的威胁我没法活{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}said I couldn't handle life without the threat of war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.30,0:32:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样的说话怎么可对男子汉说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of thing is that to say to a man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.99,0:33:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不知道 毕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I don't know, Burt…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.61,0:33:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 是其它东西才令我低落{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, it takes more than that to get me down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.31,0:33:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我整天四处跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I been running around so much, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.96,0:33:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能在家中找到我还算幸运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's lucky you caught me home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.70,0:33:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么 不知你对这事有没兴趣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, in that case, I don't know if you'd be interested in this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.61,0:33:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现身处墨西哥 看…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am down in Mexico, see, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.73,0:33:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得自己处于很为难的境况{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I find myself in a sort of situation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.33,0:33:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你处于什么困境？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of situation?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.03,0:33:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是加博怪虫的问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A graboid kind of situation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.35,0:33:42.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 你负责监察那荧光幕？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you keeping an eye on that monitor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.35,0:33:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我负责 它们还停留于北方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yeah, I am watching it. They're just staying up north.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.10,0:33:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 噢 我的天 - 什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, my God. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.67,0:34:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 你来 你来 看这处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here. Come here. Look at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.07,0:34:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在月前对这化石已进行研究{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have been staring at this fossil for over a month, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.08,0:34:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我今天才知道这是什么来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I just realized what it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.38,0:34:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱尔 那好像它们的长尖简{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Earl, that looks like one of those spikes on their sides.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.10,0:34:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 非常相似{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, it resembles one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.88,0:34:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想一定是 我很肯定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it is. I really think it is{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.53,0:34:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是加博的化石碎片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a fossil fragment of a graboid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.39,0:34:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才知需要多月来去证明这一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's going to take months to prove…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.39,0:34:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.55,0:34:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是很重要的 对吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}his is important, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.12,0:34:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,科学永没法断定它们的来源{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Science has never determined their origin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.86,0:34:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾在人民杂志读到这{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I read that in People.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.40,0:34:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,很正确 但那不是唯一的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's true. But that's not the only thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.50,0:34:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是全金比因石{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys, this is Precambrian rock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.14,0:34:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,金比因{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Precambrian…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.73,0:34:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,意即比地球还要早出现的生物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means that this is the oldest life form on the planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.67,0:34:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是 除了单细胞生物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean other than one-celled things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.81,0:34:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,但 看看这{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But look at that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.77,0:34:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等一下 是否比恐龙还古老 - 绝对是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait a minute. Older than dinosaurs? - Way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.43,0:34:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 它们是在地球上繁衍 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So they're from earth, right? Yeah. Damn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.10,0:34:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 我还以为它们从外星来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always thought they were from outer space.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.76,0:34:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点也不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't look like it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.13,0:35:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 看 那好大啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mira, mira. El monstruo mas grande… viene aca.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.26,0:35:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,看…看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. Look at the seismograph. Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.43,0:35:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,看那体积 很巨大啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}El monstruo viene. Es grande.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.45,0:35:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那并不是加博{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It ain't no graboid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.92,0:35:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,定是比加博还危险的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's something more dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.75,0:35:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怀疑这是总部吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monster H.Q., I presume.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.47,0:35:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 毕 见到你真好 - 爱尔 见到你真好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Burt, good to see you. - Earl, good to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.21,0:35:47.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是姬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, this is Kate, uh, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.12,0:35:50.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕度 你好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pedro, Hey, what's up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.14,0:35:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 朱利奥 荣幸 - 荣幸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Julio, and, uh… - The pleasure is mine. Grady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.32,0:35:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,加迪·何化{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grady Hoover.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.33,0:35:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我全认识你们 金玛先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I read all about you, Mr… Mr. Gummer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.30,0:35:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真是很大的荣幸 - 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, it's a real… real honor. - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.49,0:36:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,还以为你的货车够宽大呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, you think you got a big enough truck here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.74,0:36:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是新丁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He the new guy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.49,0:36:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有否带地震仪来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, did you get me one of those seismo-monitors?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.07,0:36:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有问题 喂 你在哪里得到这个东西？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, no problem. What you got in this thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.50,0:36:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 喂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey, hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.31,0:36:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要触摸 不准触摸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't touch. Don't touch. Easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.50,0:36:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那很容易 墨西哥军送来货车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mexican army gave me this truck…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.51,0:36:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时还送来其它我要求的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a few little items on my wish list.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.19,0:36:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那太过份了 你认为是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's, uh, a bit much, don't you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.17,0:36:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者是我错…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I am wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.43,0:36:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但希望我是对的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope I am right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.54,0:36:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,令我自制的火药沦落为爆竹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Makes my home-made stuff look like cherry bombs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.01,0:37:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,撒姆炸药 G-4 全顶级炸药{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thermite, C-4, TNT, high-explosive… H.E.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.42,0:37:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,世上有没有低爆炸性的东西呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there such thing as "low-explosive"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.46,0:37:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,有 小孩 当然有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, y-yes, son, there is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.70,0:37:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,墨军军官有求必应{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, the federales offer you anything you want, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.92,0:37:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们只拿了一箱炸药？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you guys take one case of dynamite?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.56,0:37:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底那些要来作什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is this thing for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.39,0:37:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能成为我的收藏品{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That, uh, might end up in my collection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.40,0:37:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 为你们带来一些新产品{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, got some, uh, new equipment for you, gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.57,0:37:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的后备武器 你能运用吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your backup weapons. Can you handle a firearm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.58,0:37:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看一看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will check him out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.40,0:37:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,猎枪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shotguns?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.58,0:37:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们并非去打小兔子呀 毕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not hunting rabbits down here, Burt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.06,0:37:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,并非猎枪 这里有双响炮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not shotguns. Double rifles. Elephant guns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.59,0:37:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,象枪 480型李察威斯利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wesley-Richards 480, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.36,0:37:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,375H麦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}375 HandH Mag.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.86,0:37:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,全部具有强大的毁坏力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knockdown power up the yin-yang.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.17,0:37:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好对待它们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Treat them well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.73,0:37:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但用它们时记紧紧贴你的肩部{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But hold them good night to your shoulder, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.65,0:37:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,如没贴紧你的锁骨 便很容易被打碎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or they will break your collarbone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.50,0:37:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那金玛太太在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So where's, uh, Mrs. Gummer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.03,0:37:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不想参加吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She didn't want to come?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.40,0:38:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃…你拿着这个吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, why don't you get this, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.43,0:38:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们货车上的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}uh, stuff in our truck?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.05,0:38:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 没问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, no problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.77,0:38:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 我很感谢你们来到这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, man, I… really want to thank you for coming down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.17,0:38:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的处境并非乐观{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in pretty deep here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.63,0:38:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要这样说 爱尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, forget it, Earl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.63,0:38:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实告诉你 如不出来做些事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To tell you the truth, if I didn't get out of that house, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.39,0:38:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我一定发疯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was going to go crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.64,0:38:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,希达不会回到我身边了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heather's not coming back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.47,0:38:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.34,0:38:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,她叫我把她的HK-9枪寄给她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She called me and told me to send her the H.K. 91.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.27,0:38:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,很不妙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whew. Ouch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.87,0:38:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.31,0:38:47.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论如何{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.02,0:38:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如做些有建设性的事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it will be good to get into something constructive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.66,0:38:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,天 这是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my. What is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.01,0:39:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,加士利单步枪 五十口径步枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grizzly single-shot 50-calibre B.M.G…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.06,0:39:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,全基于世界大战的爆炸性仿制{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}based on a World War I{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.23,0:39:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,而造成的子弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}antitank cartridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.39,0:39:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,反坦克？那些子弹全部人手用铜制成的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Antitank? Had the bullets custom cast from solid bronze.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.95,0:39:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕 你为超级杀伤力注入新意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, Burt, you put a whole new shine on the word "overkill."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.38,0:39:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你需要它 但又没在手上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you need it and don't have it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.45,0:39:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你的说法就不一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you sing a different tune.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.05,0:39:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样了吧 毕 好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this is it, Burt. Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.63,0:39:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去东面视察 你去西面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will patrol east. You take the west.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.27,0:40:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知那些怪虫十分恐怖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, those are terrible for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.95,0:40:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需吸收大量炭水化合物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need complex carbohydrates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.89,0:40:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但请降低你的胆固醇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lower those LDL's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.59,0:40:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已戒烟了 毕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I already gave up smoking, Burt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.06,0:40:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还要我怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What more do you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.30,0:40:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 食个快餐 - 食什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Have an M.R.E. - A what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.58,0:40:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,快餐 急冻 锡纸保鲜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meals Ready to Eat. Freeze-dried, foil sealed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.74,0:40:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,只先锡纸保装 保鲜纸易坏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got to be foil. Plastic is not an oxygen barrier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.23,0:40:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,快餐包括 主菜 饼干 芝士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Includes entree, cracker pack, cheese spread, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.75,0:40:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,杂果 饮料粉 汤匙 咖啡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}mixed fruit, beverage powder, spoon, coffee, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.70,0:40:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,奶粉 糖果 盐 火柴和面纸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}cream substitute, candy, salt, matches, toilet tissue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.74,0:40:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,可储藏十年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shelf life of ten years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.49,0:40:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 拿一些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, take a few.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.65,0:40:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我时常去买 省得去超级市场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buy them all the time. Saves trips to the supermarket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.10,0:40:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用客气 毕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, Burt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.77,0:40:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不好意思吃你的食物 - 没问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We don't want to use up all your food. - No problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.06,0:40:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我买了一百二十磅{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brought 120 pounds of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.36,0:40:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运 朋友们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck, compadres.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.79,0:41:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些好像厕纸那样难吃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man, this stuff tastes like toilet paper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.79,0:41:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱尔 那才是厕纸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Earl, that is the toilet paper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.23,0:41:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,十四号 五月… 1500小时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}14 May. 1500 hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.73,0:41:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有很确定加博所在的指数{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a confirmed graboid reading.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.23,0:41:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正运用爱尔·巴锡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am now employing the technique pioneered by Earl Basset…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.82,0:41:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,传授的技俩去发出我的第一炮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to make my first kill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.93,0:41:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标已受饵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Subject has taken the bait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.50,0:41:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备发炮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Preparing to fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.17,0:42:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,记录…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Memo:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.49,0:42:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,四磅C-4可能…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four pounds of C-4 may be a little…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.31,0:42:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,太多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}excessive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.40,0:42:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 加迪 爱尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, Grady and Earl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.41,0:42:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打到一只 完毕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got one. Over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.88,0:42:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了 毕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we know, Burt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.97,0:42:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们听得很清楚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We heard it clear over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.45,0:42:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是只极可恶的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damnedest thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.66,0:42:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,有条大铁链从它的口中垂下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It had a big chain hanging out of its mouth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.94,0:42:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕 你卑鄙 那只是我们的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it. Burt, you skunk, that one was ours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.89,0:42:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 小孩？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, son?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.89,0:42:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看不见有你的名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't see your name on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.70,0:42:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,通话 结束{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over and out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.29,0:42:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何我们邀请他加入？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did we invite him, anyway?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.81,0:42:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 留神呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, pay attention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.27,0:43:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈 我看到一只 等一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa. We got one. Wait a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.26,0:43:02.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,它远离我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's moving away from us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.27,0:43:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是其它东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must be something else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.91,0:43:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么？巨大的牧场狗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like what, a giant prairie dog?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.45,0:43:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 我不知道 爱尔 它正远离我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, shit, I don't know, Earl. It's moving away from us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.69,0:43:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,要跟踪它吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should we follow it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.29,0:43:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底它是怎么搞的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is the matter with him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.86,0:43:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已发出这么大的噪音{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're making plenty of noise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.94,0:43:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,太不好了 加迪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like it, Grady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.47,0:43:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们变得很聪明 它们学乖了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're getting smarter. That's what they do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.41,0:43:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们一定在进行某些计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They got some kind of plan going here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.67,0:43:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tell you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.29,0:43:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们一定有新计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}these boys are up to something new.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.53,0:43:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,掘陷阱等我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're digging a trap for us, or…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.59,0:43:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者…装死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}playing possum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.51,0:43:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定不会简单{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.04,0:44:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣母保佑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy Mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.31,0:44:07.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢天 噢天 噢天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man, oh, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.80,0:44:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,蠢蛋 为何我会这样做？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit. Shit, how could I do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.82,0:44:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,要去拿毕的枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to get to Burt's gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.54,0:44:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在哪里？它应该在附近才对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he? Should be all over us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.21,0:44:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.41,0:44:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是什么？是它们做的吗？- 嘘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is that? Can they do that? - Shh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.37,0:44:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a new one on me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.01,0:44:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝 加迪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, Grady, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.01,0:44:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在做什么？快离开地面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}what are you doing? Get off the ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.50,0:44:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道 知道 我有个主意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, I know. I got an idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.49,0:44:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,信任我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.13,0:45:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 加油 快回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, Grady, come on back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.70,0:45:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,它仍在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's still there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.92,0:45:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,它到底在做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell's it doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.60,0:45:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.89,0:46:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这东西有些不妥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's wrong with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.66,0:46:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是生病{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must be sick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.66,0:46:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者它吃了的人令它肠胃不适{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably ate somebody that didn't agree with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.81,0:46:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝 加迪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, Grady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.96,0:46:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 爱尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, Earl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.72,0:46:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,它不会去别处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not going anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.16,0:46:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.79,0:46:47.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们刚活捉一只{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just caught ourselves a live one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.44,0:46:51.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是十万元 爱尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's $100, 000, Earl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.71,0:46:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 棒 - 是吗？你想怎么样？背它回来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, yes. - Oh, yeah? What're you going to do, carry him back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.78,0:46:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的货车刚毁坏了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just wrecked the truck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.67,0:47:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.69,0:47:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 这边是爱尔 有人在吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, this is Earl to anybody. Anybody there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.90,0:47:18.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱尔 我是姬 你们怎么样了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Earl, it's Kate. How're you guys doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.49,0:47:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们受到了一点撞击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we kind of wrecked our truck a little bit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.73,0:47:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？你没事吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? A-Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.64,0:47:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 不过我们需要人到这里接应{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're fine. We're going to need somebody to come fetch us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.81,0:47:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,等下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just for a sec.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.41,0:47:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 请叫毕度驶他的旧货车来接应{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, would you tell Pedro to bring that big old truck of his out here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.43,0:47:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一座吊臂在货车上 对吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got a crane on it, doesn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.85,0:47:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.65,0:47:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他要很久才能到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's going to take him hours to get there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.01,0:47:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论如何 叫他驶过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him to bring it out here because…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.70,0:47:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,才能运它到邪恶世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to winch that slinky off to Monster World.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.86,0:47:45.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,请即闭嘴 同时立即离开地面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off the damn ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.19,0:47:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我立即离开 马上走开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am off. I am off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.55,0:48:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.98,0:48:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶 他得到另外一只{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, he got himself another one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.22,0:48:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,永不见那人睡觉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man never sleeps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.22,0:48:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 这是毕 我仍在搜罗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, Burt here, doing a little night fishing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.23,0:48:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有三只聚在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got three of them on a cluster charge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.37,0:48:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我们大家打个平手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say we're about even now. Over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.50,0:48:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 毕 这并不是场比赛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Burt. This isn't a competition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.63,0:48:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁人在比试？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's competing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.24,0:48:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是说大家得个平分而已{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am just saying the score's tied, that's all. Over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.56,0:48:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友 我们活捉了一只{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}well son, no it isn't, because we just caught ourselves a live one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.24,0:48:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你感受如何？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.24,0:48:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,生擒？那怎么会发…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A live one? How in the…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.24,0:48:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,唔 那是小小的商业秘密 狩猎愉快 毕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a trade secret. Happy hunting, Burt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.88,0:48:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我肯定那令到他很气恼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will bet that burned his skinny ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.77,0:48:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,全能上帝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}God Almighty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.01,0:48:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的小虫有些不妥当 爱尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's wrong with our worm, Earl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.69,0:49:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想我怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what do you want me to do about it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.28,0:49:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者有其它的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe something's trying{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.57,0:49:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,想吃了它 可能是野狼吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to eat it out there… coyotes or something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.81,0:49:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们有很多东西可吃 对吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will have plenty to eat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.37,0:49:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 爱尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Earl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.27,0:49:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们快保护我们投资品{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have got to protect our investment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.20,0:49:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可只坐在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't just sit here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.29,0:49:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,天 仔细听{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, listen to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.97,0:49:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怜 其实 你有否可怜它？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor thing. I mean, don't you just feel a little sorry for him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.61,0:49:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.82,0:49:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那太冷血了 爱尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's cold, Earl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.58,0:49:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个毕度在何处 那坏货车呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's that Pedro and that damn truck?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.62,0:50:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,某些东西…吃了它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something ate it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.12,0:50:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,只两分钟？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In two minutes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.10,0:50:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定有事发生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, something happened to it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.50,0:50:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为里面什么都没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}because there is nothing left inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.37,0:50:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,有东西从里面跑出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something came out of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.94,0:50:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思 有什么跑出来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, something came out of it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.81,0:50:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 有一种动物是这样变身{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It did that thing that things do when they change, you know…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.93,0:50:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一句话来形容的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's a word for it, uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.11,0:50:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那会变成不同的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It turned into something else{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.38,0:50:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像毛虫变蝴蝶那样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}like a caterpillar does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.38,0:50:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论它变成什么东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only I bet that whatever came out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.05,0:50:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定不会是美丽的蝴蝶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}wasn't no sweet little butterfly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.59,0:51:09.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那死虫永不令人轻松一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn worms never cut you any slack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.83,0:51:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说我认为你应跑去里奥华地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said I think you all ought to head out to Rioverde.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.57,0:51:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到我们知道这是什么事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear out until we know what's going on. Over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.68,0:51:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,通话 姬？那东西有否出现？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kate, did you get any of that? Over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.42,0:51:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,通话 可恶 又怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit. Now, what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.03,0:51:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,通话器坏了 怎么会这样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The radio's out. How could that be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.94,0:51:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才我还与她讲话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just talking to her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.43,0:51:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂…你知那是什么 对吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man. You know what that is, don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.07,0:51:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 另外一只正做同样的事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Another one's doing it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.10,0:51:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 毕度在那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There. There's Pedro.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.43,0:51:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多是时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}About damn time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.23,0:52:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他停下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He stopped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.32,0:52:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他停下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He stopped?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.86,0:52:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者他正在小便{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he's taking a leak?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.24,0:52:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那小便真久{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a long leak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.10,0:52:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 毕度 毕度{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Pedro. Pedro.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.15,0:52:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.04,0:52:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者我们要走去看个究竟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe we should go over and see what's wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.22,0:52:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,走过去？你说在荒野上走一里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go over? You mean, walk a mile across open country?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.60,0:52:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不离开这地震仪超过六尺{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not going six feet from that seismo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.65,0:52:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 我们附近肯定没有加博{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. There's no graboids anywhere near us right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.61,0:52:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去一定没有事发生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I say we go while the going's good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.35,0:53:06.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可携带一些这物品{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you could carry some of this stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.51,0:53:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已拥有我想要的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got what I want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.30,0:53:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能说很好 毕度？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I can't say this looks good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.94,0:53:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕度{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pedro?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.11,0:53:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 毕度{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Pedro.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.08,0:53:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,带来了旧回忆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This brings back memories.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.22,0:53:54.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像有人拿罐头刀去那东西处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus. Looks like somebody took a can opener to the thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.96,0:53:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不妙…看看那引擎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man. Look at that engine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.46,0:54:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,全部粉碎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's torn to pieces.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.30,0:54:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕度{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pedro.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.07,0:54:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶 你在哪？喂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it. Where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.25,0:54:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. There he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.84,0:54:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕度…？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pedro?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.99,0:54:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God. Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.59,0:54:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个全新的游戏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a whole new ball game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.60,0:54:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,崭新的游戏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A whole new goddamn ball game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.71,0:54:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知应怎么样做 是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well… Well, you know what to do, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.45,0:54:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吗？我全不知{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right? I don't know shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.08,0:54:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好…好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.81,0:54:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可步行到讯号塔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can hike over to that radio tower.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.61,0:54:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们定有好的通话机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Th-Th-They have got to have a radio that's working.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.29,0:54:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可直接致电去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can, uh… We can call direct.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.39,0:55:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,十四号 五月 黄昏十时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}14 May. 1900 hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.03,0:55:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,已数小时不能使用通讯机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have been out of radio contact for several hours, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.30,0:55:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,无法联络到加迪和爱尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}unable to reach Grady and Earl{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.84,0:55:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,或在总部的人 照情况看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or anybody at H.Q.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.65,0:55:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我非要返回基地不可{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The situation dictates that I return to base.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.96,0:55:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,更进一步的谜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A further mystery:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.34,0:55:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,已有数小时没有测量记录{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have not had a single seismic reading in hours, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.58,0:55:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我是追踪着加博来到这山谷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}yet I tracked one of the sightless brutes right into this valley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.68,0:55:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底它去了哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell did he go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.95,0:56:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们真的变得聪明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They do get smarter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.46,0:56:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,它真能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it possible he learned…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.11,0:56:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,辨别我货物的引擎声？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to avoid the unique sound of my deuce-and-half's mil-spec engine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.70,0:56:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也没法解答这问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not have the answer at this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.49,0:56:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 不要 不要…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.56,0:56:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要告诉我又是通讯机事故{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't tell me that's the radio stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.55,0:56:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不可以相信这{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.15,0:56:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,天…我们能否好运些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man. Can't we ever get a goddamn break?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.31,0:56:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们能活着离开这地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we get out of here alive, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.45,0:56:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已非常幸运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will count that as a break.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.87,0:56:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 这地方并没有人类可吃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, there wasn't even any people here to eat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.73,0:56:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们这样做一定有目的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're doing this on purpose, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.76,0:56:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们有目的地令我们孤立无援{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're cutting us off on purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.78,0:56:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,静 静点…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh. Shh. Quiet. Quiet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.21,0:56:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已告知你它们变得很聪明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you they get smarter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.75,0:57:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey… look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.61,0:57:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我们不会有车匙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes. Yes. It's not going to have a key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.42,0:57:12.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 即是说我要想办法推动引擎 - 正合我意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So I will hot-wire the damn thing. - I like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.14,0:57:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,加迪 加迪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grady. Grady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.18,0:57:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.24,0:57:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 但它正朝这边走来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, but it's coming this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.70,0:57:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝 那东西有多大？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus. How big is this thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.54,0:58:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.66,0:58:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,是它吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.71,0:58:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定不是只驼鸟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure ain't no damn ostrich.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.78,0:58:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个三十尺大的虫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does a 30-foot worm{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.36,0:58:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会变成如此细小呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}turn into that little thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.47,0:58:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,静 它可能听到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh. Might hear us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.47,0:58:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好 它听到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit. It heard us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.48,0:58:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.29,0:58:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,捉到它了 捉到它了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got it. We got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.47,0:59:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,丑陋的癞虾蟆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugly little toad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.11,0:59:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,没眼睛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.89,0:59:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 好像那些大的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. Just like the big ones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.18,0:59:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱尔 可…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Earl, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.98,0:59:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们定要带走这只{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We ought to take this one with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.69,0:59:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了吗？ 为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You crazy? What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.15,0:59:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像有很多这些东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like a bunch of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.90,0:59:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 朋友…我们走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man. Let's go. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.75,0:59:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在尝试 我在尝试{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am trying. I am trying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.18,0:59:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.96,1:00:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕度 你听到我吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pedro. Can you hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.39,1:00:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱尔 来吧…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Earl, come on. Talk to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.79,1:00:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我通话 毕？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burt? Anybody?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.77,1:00:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底发生了什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}God. What the hell is going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.24,1:00:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 噢…噢 - 嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, man. - Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.41,1:00:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 朱利奥 你吓得我半死 - 对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Julio, man, you scared me half to death. - Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.98,1:00:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.98,1:00:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知那些通讯机 全坏了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the radios… They're out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.48,1:01:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我正在抢救{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. That's what I have been doing here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.95,1:01:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想通讯塔可能坏了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think the repeater towers are down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.19,1:01:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那怎么会呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can that be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.69,1:01:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不清楚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.19,1:01:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,有东西朝我们这边来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something coming our way?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.91,1:01:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 那些生物在荧幕上全消失{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. The creatures have completely disappeared off the screen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.24,1:01:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,很奇怪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's weird.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.64,1:01:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果通讯机全坏了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the radios all out, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.06,1:01:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那全部人不是要回来吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}shouldn't everybody come back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.50,1:01:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,对呀 全部人早应全部撤回{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, everybody should have been here a long time ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.45,1:01:21.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢这样 这样不好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like this. This is not good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.37,1:01:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好…姬 你守着地震仪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, stay here with the seismos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.77,1:01:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在就出去找他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am going to go look for them right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.98,1:01:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 噢 我的天 我的天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, but…oh oh oh{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.79,1:02:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,救他 救他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him. Get him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.63,1:02:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,畜生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bastards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.39,1:02:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,姬…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.77,1:02:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什？那是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.17,1:02:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也不知{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.21,1:02:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些怪虫不知怎么的蜕变了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The worms change somehow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.89,1:02:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在又有这些东西出现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we have got these things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.02,1:02:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,朱利奥…朱利奥…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Julio. Julio. They… They…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.75,1:02:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知 我知{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.84,1:02:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们打败它们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got them, though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.94,1:02:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们刚轰走它们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just blew them away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.15,1:02:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕度 毕度有否找到你？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pedro. Did Pedro find you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.35,1:02:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 他们发动他的货车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. They jumped his truck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.45,1:02:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕度已身亡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dead too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.57,1:02:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有看见毕？他回来了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you seen Burt? Did he get back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.53,1:02:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 我尝试与他通话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I tried to call him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.67,1:02:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我又试过与你通话 那通讯机 - 哦 不好意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I tried you. The radio… - Uh, excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.40,1:02:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要立即出发{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I think we should get going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.54,1:03:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧？- 你无恙吧 没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You okay? - Uh-huh. Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.92,1:03:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 不要 不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. Not again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.38,1:03:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们搞坏了我们的车子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They wrecked our car, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.53,1:03:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕度的货车 通讯塔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pedro's truck, the radio tower.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.43,1:03:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何它们会那么聪明？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can they be so smart?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.97,1:03:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们快走进去？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get our butts inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.17,1:03:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要做什么才好？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell we going to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.29,1:03:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 关掉所有窗口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get these windows shut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.02,1:03:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们对这事好像全有计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like they got the whole thing planned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.29,1:03:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,加迪…加迪 来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grady. Grady. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.75,1:03:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 你认为它们数目有多少？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. How many do you think there are?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.11,1:03:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我记得…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I remember. I remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.65,1:03:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得有三个大袋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was three big sacks, or bags, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.24,1:03:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者那些袋子裂开缝 爱尔？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in that one we saw split open. Huh, Earl?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.83,1:03:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,在怪虫的肚子里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't be more than three of those things{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.45,1:03:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,应不会超过三只那些异形{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in each worm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.79,1:03:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我估计 你说得对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I… I… That's right, I guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.13,1:03:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,姬 外面还剩下多少只怪虫？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kate, how many big worms were left out there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.00,1:04:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只杀死八只加博 我很留神地监察着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed all but eight graboids. I was watching.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.17,1:04:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果那八只全部蜕变{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if all eight of them changed, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.77,1:04:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那有…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that would make, uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.20,1:04:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,二十四只{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twenty-four.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.95,1:04:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那剩下二十四只异形{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twenty-four of those things left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.76,1:04:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀死多少只？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many have you killed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.31,1:04:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想想…唔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's see…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.67,1:04:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,在讯号塔杀死一只 外面一只{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We, uh… We killed one on the radio tower and…and one out there…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.86,1:04:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 唔…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, um, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.24,1:04:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,一只在车顶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}one top of the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.56,1:04:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,就那么多？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.63,1:04:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,很惭愧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I am sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.01,1:04:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 不妙… 那么 我意思是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. It's just that I mean…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.77,1:04:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 又是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man. Now what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.34,1:04:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢上天 是毕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank God, it's Burt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.52,1:04:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 他没被杀死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. They didn't get him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.80,1:04:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为他死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think they did get him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.93,1:05:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕？毕…？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.27,1:05:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧 毕？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burt, you okay? Burt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.25,1:05:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得有人蓄意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel I was denied…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.03,1:05:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,把最重要的基本资料隐瞒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}critical, need-to-know information.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.76,1:05:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也不想 毕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we're sorry, Burt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.76,1:05:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们的生态突然全改变{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They just changed all of a sudden, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.96,1:05:37.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,本应我们可警告你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We would have warned you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.94,1:05:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但它们将通讯塔毁坏了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they knocked out the radio tower.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.12,1:05:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底 毕 发生了什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Burt. What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.55,1:05:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,当线路断了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, when the radios went out, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.59,1:05:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我决定返练油厂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I decided to return to the refinery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.14,1:05:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,中途上 我觉得四击有埋伏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But en route, I find I am in an ambush situation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.28,1:05:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信有数十只那些怪物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must have been a couple of dozen of these things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.25,1:06:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我即运用半自动机枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I dropped the first wave with semi auto fire, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.14,1:06:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但它们始终不断侵入进来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they just kept coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.82,1:06:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸运地 它们大都在货车前面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most were in front of the truck, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.84,1:06:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我便用货车辗过它们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I popped it in six-wheel and ran them down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.68,1:06:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中一只侵入车内 我便随机应变{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ones that got on board, I handled with a combination…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.96,1:06:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,用了近身武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of small arms fire and hand-to-hand techniques.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.07,1:06:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那真吓坏了我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am completely out of ammo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.74,1:06:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,同样的事不要再发生在我身上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's never happened to me before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.95,1:06:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶…谁会理会 毕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, shit. Who cares, Burt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.49,1:06:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像你把它们全部杀清 是吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like you killed them all, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.09,1:06:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望没有 这些生物很重要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope not. These creatures are very important.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.73,1:06:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我意思是 在科学上来说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I mean scientifically.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.40,1:06:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能忘记刚发生的一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That fact was not lost on me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.33,1:06:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,事后 我见一只小杂种吓呆了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When it was all over, I saw one of the little SOB's was just stunned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.67,1:06:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我便捉住它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I detained him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.01,1:07:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,天 你在胡说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man, it's drooling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.01,1:07:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不要被吓坏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let him spook you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.09,1:07:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时对自己的说话要负责{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That line is 1, 000-pound test.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.16,1:07:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧 把它拖上来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on. Haul him out of there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.51,1:09:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早知道 红外线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it. Infrared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.42,1:09:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那异形怪物并不真正看到人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't hear us. It doesn't actually see us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.89,1:09:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们利用触角去探测人类体热{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It senses the heat of our bodies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.99,1:09:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,看那…那升起的东西？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See that? The thing that rises{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.78,1:09:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是探测热度的触角{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}up must be the heat sensor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.03,1:09:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 感觉到吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You feel that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.82,1:09:44.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,当他吼叫时会发出大量热气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gives off a lot of heat when it screams.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.05,1:09:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是我相信它们靠这通讯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it. I bet that's the way they communicate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.24,1:10:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,声音是无关重要的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sound doesn't matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.43,1:10:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,即是 它们虽发出声音{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They make noise, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.52,1:10:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,但它们靠体热互转消息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they signal each other with their body heat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.00,1:10:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们只探测到热量？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It only sees heat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.07,1:10:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 那也不太怪诞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, that's not so weird.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.76,1:10:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,响尾蛇就是热度袭击的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A rattlesnake strikes at body heat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.07,1:10:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是它们毁坏汽车的原因 因为引擎热{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why they tore up the cars… because the engines were hot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.08,1:10:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们以为是食物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They thought it was food.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.05,1:10:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,通讯塔同一道理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the same thing with the radio tower.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.87,1:10:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些电子齿轮发出各样的热气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That electronic gear puts off all kinds of heat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.55,1:10:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,基本上 它们吃所有暖的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So basically, they bite anything that's warm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.39,1:10:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说 它们表现得很智慧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They been acting so smart{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.05,1:10:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实是因为它们很愚蠢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}because they're so stupid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.98,1:10:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但 那不暖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, that's not warm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.31,1:10:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,它又为何懂得去吃它呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does he know to eat that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.18,1:10:49.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,它用舌头试味道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it tastes it with its tongue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.59,1:10:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没看见它整天拖着舌头走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See how he's dragging his tongue all over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.44,1:10:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果它碰到喜欢的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Touches anything he likes, uh, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.63,1:10:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,它就吃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he eats it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.31,1:10:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,它有多大食量？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much can he eat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.31,1:10:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些快餐并不便宜 你知吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those MRE's aren't cheap, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.33,1:11:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来它已吃饱了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like he's had enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.94,1:11:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喂它太多 你令它感到不适{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're feeding it too much. You made it sick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.41,1:11:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,放过我吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a break.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.60,1:11:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你的食物令它不适才对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably your nasty food made it sick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.12,1:11:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 仁慈上帝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, good God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.18,1:12:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,雌雄同体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hermaphrodites.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.46,1:12:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们不需异性去繁殖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They reproduce without having sex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.83,1:12:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我先要小的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I claim the little one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.37,1:12:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 那是我的食物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, wait a minute, it was my food.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.08,1:12:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,当它们吃饱肚子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whenever one of them gets enough food, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.24,1:12:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们就…另外一只就出来 然后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}they just bla-a-ah, and there's another one. And then{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.67,1:12:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,一化二 二化四{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}one makes two, two makes four, four{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.34,1:12:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,四化八 那指数学{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}makes eight… it's exponential.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.68,1:12:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, uh, hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.68,1:12:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那对它们很有利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That gives them quite an edge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.48,1:12:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,在高等动物中没有这情况{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never see this in higher animals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.65,1:12:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来没有 很令人震惊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}ever. It's astounding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.89,1:12:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们明白吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you guys get it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.39,1:12:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白 我们只是不想去想它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, we get it. We just don't want it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.86,1:12:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想那小的已变大了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The little one's getting big already.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.75,1:12:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候来计划离开这处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I think we better think about leaving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.46,1:12:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些怪物有他自己一套进化论{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These guys have taken a completely different evolutionary path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.24,1:13:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们吃了你的特级食物 爱尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They got into your damn super-food, Burt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.31,1:13:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,货仓 我们要关好货仓 噢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The warehouse. We got to close the warehouse. Oh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.12,1:13:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这边 - 加迪 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This way. - Grady. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.16,1:13:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,加迪 不 不 非这样 加迪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Not that way. Grady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.73,1:13:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 加迪 可恶 那是行不通的 - 好 好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Grady, damn it.. This isn't going to work. - All right. All right{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.50,1:13:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.02,1:13:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们停了下来 它们在兜圈子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They stopped. They're just milling around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.44,1:13:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它们好像追踪不到我们 - 对 但…这不会持久{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Looks like they lost track of us. - That's not going to last.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.96,1:13:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正坐以待弊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're like sitting ducks here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.06,1:14:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我觉得那像座大楼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it looked like a goddamn building.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.77,1:14:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为何不听我的话？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you listen to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.08,1:14:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 那些蠢东西又盲又聋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These little snappers are blind and deaf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.79,1:14:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一定有办法收拾他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have got to be able to beat them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.73,1:14:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早告诉你它们看不见我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you, they can't see us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.20,1:14:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好 现在又做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great, now what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.80,1:14:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟随着我移动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, move with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.31,1:14:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,移动？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.61,1:14:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那会成功的 可恶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's going to work, damn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.93,1:14:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,立即动身 一步…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now move. And step, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.38,1:14:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,一步…一步{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and step and step…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.19,1:14:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知你怎么想出这鬼主意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how you come up with this shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.82,1:14:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有我做事方法 看 见效了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think on my feet. Come on. It's working.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.38,1:14:56.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟着你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming at you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.55,1:15:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那 我们去哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So… where are we going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.14,1:15:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有没有汽车剩下？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are there any more cars left?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.66,1:15:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,唔…唔…有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, uh, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.08,1:15:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,一辆 朱利奥的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One. Julio's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.16,1:15:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.37,1:15:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,储藏柜旁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}by the storage tank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.49,1:15:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪个方向？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which way?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.02,1:15:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,左…左{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Left. Move left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.79,1:15:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 预备动 左{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Ready and moving left, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.96,1:15:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,一步…一步 一步{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and step, and step, and step, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.02,1:15:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,一步…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and step and step.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.87,1:15:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 不用再走 停住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, it's not much further.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.28,1:15:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,天杀的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh… damn…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.88,1:15:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面有一只异形{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn, there's one of them out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.19,1:16:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,它可看见你吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit. Did it see you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.89,1:16:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不清楚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.12,1:16:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果它看见 我们早已知道了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if it had, I think we'd be hearing about it by now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.02,1:16:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,有多远？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How far is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.26,1:16:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,一…一…一百码左右{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, uh, 100 yards about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.53,1:16:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,真差劲的枪法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a heck of a shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.90,1:16:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 你只打一枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa. Whoa. You got only one shot?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.55,1:16:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你快把它打死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you got to hit it, man…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.22,1:16:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,迟些它把所有兄弟全召来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}before it sends one of those heat signals to the others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.51,1:16:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.80,1:16:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,掩住他的耳朵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cover your ears.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.74,1:16:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.25,1:16:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.94,1:16:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,连它的屁股也打不到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You smoked his ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.81,1:16:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我已在有限的资源做得最好 - 棒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Doing what I can with what I got. - Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.19,1:17:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 打开篷子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. Pop the hood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.43,1:17:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道 知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it, I got it.{\r}
