Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.34,1:27:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥罗先那 夏宁娜…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, uh… Dulce. Dulce.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.58,1:27:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 阿罗丝… - 我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sweet. Golosinas… - I know this one. Snack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.15,1:27:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,甜的小吃？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweet snack food?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.88,1:27:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦粉？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rice flour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.32,1:27:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知 我怎么知道？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know. How could I have had known?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.79,1:27:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天 它们还吃不够吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}God. Don't they ever get tired of eating?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.35,1:27:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那差不多有一百只{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There will be 100 of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.59,1:27:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 好 我们去追捕它们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we're going to run for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.59,1:27:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.60,1:27:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会成功的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not going to make it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.50,1:27:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱尔 对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. Earl, I am sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.32,1:27:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉带给你这些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am sorry I got you all into this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.84,1:28:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 加迪 我们还未死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Grady. We ain't dead yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.55,1:28:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 快点 好 什么 什么 什么 好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Come on. Okay, what, what, what, what, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.65,1:28:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个主意 刚想到的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I have got a plan. Sort of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.05,1:28:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们将这喷到我身上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to squirt me with this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.26,1:28:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 清水 那令你体温降低{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's great. CO2… It will make you cold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.29,1:28:21.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 它看不见我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. They won't see me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.48,1:28:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Says who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.63,1:28:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说得对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, they're right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.63,1:28:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是可行的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It ought to work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.46,1:28:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,维持多久？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For how long?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.47,1:28:26.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少我们要尝试{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we got to try something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.63,1:28:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,但目的呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what is the point?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.31,1:28:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我能抵达你的货车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, if I can just get to your truck, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.63,1:28:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就可以拿些炸药{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can grab some bombs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.26,1:28:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱尔 这样做太疯狂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Erl This is nuts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.84,1:28:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是呀…同时…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, yeah, and…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.64,1:28:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.10,1:28:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要发神经 那是我的主意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be stupid. It was my idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.86,1:28:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我令你身陷困境 是我错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I got you all into this. It's my fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.89,1:28:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我去货车 不得异议 - 快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I am going in. Spray me. - come on{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.46,1:28:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶 在他们出来前就要做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to do it before they break out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.51,1:28:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就炸我吧 噢 上帝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, blast me. Okay. Oh, Jesus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.52,1:28:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 - 不好 石头割开纸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. - No. Rock rips through paper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.30,1:28:54.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.11,1:28:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去 把那衬衫给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh. I go. Give me that shirt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.54,1:28:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,要有手套 这东西好冻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need the gloves too. This stuff is cold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.33,1:29:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你准备好吗？去吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready? Here goes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.45,1:29:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这东西好冻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, this stuff is cold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.60,1:29:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, here goes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.38,1:29:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把我身后的门锁好 - 锁住它？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lock this door behind me. - Lock it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.06,1:29:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 我拿了炸药后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I will get the bombs{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.53,1:29:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,会从另一道门走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and go out the other door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.14,1:29:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.80,1:30:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来起作用了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like it's working.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.75,1:30:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么也看不见 在那处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't see anything. Over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.33,1:30:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.76,1:30:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,神圣的碎肉菜 好多呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy tamole. There's dozens of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.11,1:30:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 纸包石 不是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good Lord. Wait a minute. Paper wraps rock, doesn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.88,1:30:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,纸永远包住石{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paper always wraps rock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.72,1:30:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.05,1:31:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他开始溶解{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's starting to melt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.79,1:31:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱尔 你在溶化{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Earl, you're melting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.39,1:31:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 快点 去 去 去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step on it. Come on. Go, go, go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.45,1:31:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好 它们看见他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn. They see him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.69,1:31:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,管子 我们需要管子或其他的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh… rope. We need rope or something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.58,1:31:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,在灭火筒旁有条防火喉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on, Earl. A hose. There's a hose down by the fire hydrant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.54,1:31:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,快成功了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.84,1:31:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太短{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah. It's too short.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.02,1:32:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.50,1:32:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,防火喉太短 毕 赶快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hose is too short. Burt, hurry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.82,1:32:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们走吧 快点 - 抓住 快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Heads up, Earl. - Grab it. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.72,1:32:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 快点 跑 走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go. Run. Run. Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.71,1:32:47.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我装置了炸弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I set a bomb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.92,1:32:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.88,1:32:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是唯一我可想到的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only thing I could think of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.60,1:33:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,姬 他做了什么 加迪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kate, what did he do? Grady? Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.05,1:33:05.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些炸药究竟在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell are the bombs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.32,1:33:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't have time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.22,1:33:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚丢了一个在你的货车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just threw one in your truck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.14,1:33:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做了什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.48,1:33:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是两公吨半的极品炸药{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's two-and-a-half tons of high explosives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.38,1:33:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说那些不足够？天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saying that's not enough? God, Burt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.68,1:33:16.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要告诉我那不足够{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't tell me it's not enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.79,1:33:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不够？那…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.76,1:33:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那…算了吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never mind. Never mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.09,1:33:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点跑 加快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just run. Faster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.20,1:33:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不 继续跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. Keep going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.93,1:33:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那将会很大 极巨大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's going to be big. Big.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.93,1:33:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他认真的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he serious? Uh, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.57,1:33:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕知道他炸药的威力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burt knows his bombs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.94,1:33:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那有多大？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How big can it be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.11,1:33:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你按了多少时间？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long did you set it for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.21,1:33:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 我只按了一些键子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, I just pushed it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.41,1:33:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,天 那会很大 极巨大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, it's going to be big. Big.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.22,1:33:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 这会很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, this will have to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.77,1:33:58.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,躺下 掩着耳朵 那会很大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down. Stay down, cover your ears. It's going to be big.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.96,1:34:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要在今天吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it going to be today?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.63,1:34:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,加迪 废话少说 躺下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grady, get your ass down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.00,1:34:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 加迪…你还好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Grady. Grady. Grady, you all right, man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.81,1:34:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.20,1:34:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.75,1:34:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己小心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Watch yourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.52,1:35:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,加迪 有人认为我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Grady. Some people{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.82,1:35:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,过份紧张…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}think I am overprepared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.46,1:35:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,有精神病 甚至有些少疯颠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paranoid. Maybe even a little crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.40,1:35:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那些人未接触过金拜恩生物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they never met any Precambrian life forms, did they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.82,1:35:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,唔…看 呀…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, look, uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.22,1:35:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不介意留下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't mind hanging around down here for awhile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.84,1:35:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有空吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going to have any free time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.01,1:36:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里数天就差不多被杀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, spend a couple days almost getting killed, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.72,1:36:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要为自己的将来设想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you start thinking about your future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.42,1:36:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,还以为你要多点约会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thinking you should date more?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.86,1:36:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是呀 不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, yeah, actually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.46,1:36:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 爱尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Earl, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.91,1:36:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们欠我们二十八只怪虫的酬金{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just realized they owe us for 28 worms, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.42,1:36:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那没错 我们没死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, that's right. We didn't die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.36,1:36:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然 我们几乎炸毁炼油厂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although, we did kind of blow up their refinery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.41,1:36:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我们工作的一部份{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, that's just part of the job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.45,1:36:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 那些小怪物还未计算{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, we ought to charge them for all those little ones too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.54,1:36:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我们有足够的金钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. We will have enough{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.22,1:36:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,去建造我们的游乐场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to start our own theme park…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.93,1:36:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,加迪和爱尔的怪兽天地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grady and Earl's Monster World.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.12,1:36:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 休想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, no way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.87,1:36:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 爱尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Earl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.10,1:36:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你第三次良机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This could be like your big, third chance.{\r}
